# Always ingest agent session (Sessions)

After every agent response (before ending the turn), run skill `ingest-agent-session`.

1. Resolve current composer/session UUID.
2. Prefer `dispatcher-win\agent-brain-dispatcher.exe ingest --uuid <UUID>` (extract + API ingest).
3. To refill all Sessions from `state.vscdb`: `agent-brain-dispatcher.exe sync`.
4. Fallback: extract script + MCP `ingest_session` / HTTP POST.
5. Report one short ok/fail line.

Do not skip. Do not wait for the user to ask.
Do not ingest into centralized-agent-data — agent-brain is the source of truth.
